{"seq":2,"slug":"replay-rehearsal","title":"回放与排练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/methods/replay-rehearsal","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"回放与排练\">回放与排练</h1><p>如果你问一个做持续学习评测的研究员「最强的基线是什么」，十有八九答案是回放。道理朴素得近乎作弊：既然遗忘是因为看不到旧数据，那就偷偷留一小撮旧样本，每次学新任务时掺进去一起训。这个想法简单到让人怀疑还有什么可研究的，但围绕「存什么、怎么存、怎么用、不能存原始数据怎么办」，回放发展成了持续学习里内容最丰富的方法家族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回放（replay，也叫 rehearsal 排练）的核心是维护一个容量有界的记忆缓冲区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，存放历史任务的少量样本。学第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个任务时，优化目标不再只看当前数据，而是同时看缓冲区里的旧样本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>replay</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{replay}}(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim D_k}[\\mathcal{L}(f_\\theta(x), y)] + \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim \\mathcal{M}}[\\mathcal{L}(f_\\theta(x), y)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">replay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二项把旧任务的梯度信号重新注入优化，相当于不停地把模型往旧任务的低损失盆地（盆地概念见 <a href=\"../foundations/catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘机理</a>）里拉。这直接呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/stability-plasticity\">稳定性与可塑性权衡</a> 里提到的大脑「睡眠回放」机制——回放是最具生物合理性的持续学习方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[任务 Tk 数据流] --&gt; B[当前 batch]&#10;    C[记忆缓冲区 M&lt;br/&gt;历史样本] --&gt; D[采样旧 batch]&#10;    B --&gt; E[混合 batch]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[联合训练: 新损失 + 旧损失]&#10;    F --&gt; G[更新缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;蓄水池采样]&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt; H{缓冲区放原始数据?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[经验回放]&#10;    H --&gt;|否, 用生成器| J[生成式回放]\">flowchart TD\n    A[任务 Tk 数据流] --&gt; B[当前 batch]\n    C[记忆缓冲区 M&lt;br/&gt;历史样本] --&gt; D[采样旧 batch]\n    B --&gt; E[混合 batch]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[联合训练: 新损失 + 旧损失]\n    F --&gt; G[更新缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;蓄水池采样]\n    G --&gt; C\n    F --&gt; H{缓冲区放原始数据?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[经验回放]\n    H --&gt;|否, 用生成器| J[生成式回放]</pre><h2 id=\"缓冲区怎么填-采样与管理策略\">缓冲区怎么填：采样与管理策略</h2><p>缓冲区容量固定，但数据流无界，于是「保留哪些样本」成了关键决策。最经典的是蓄水池采样（reservoir sampling）：流式数据下，让缓冲区里每个样本都以相同概率来自整个历史流，无需知道流总长。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathcal{M}|/t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 替换缓冲区里随机一个，保证任意时刻缓冲区是历史的均匀子集。</p>\n<p>更聪明的策略则按「价值」选样本。带阻尼蓄水池、梯度最大多样性（GSS）倾向保留梯度方向各异的样本以覆盖更广的旧知识；基于不确定性或边界的策略保留靠近决策边界的难样本。下表对比常见管理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>选样依据</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蓄水池采样</td>\n<td>均匀随机</td>\n<td>实现简单、无偏</td>\n<td>不感知样本价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSS 梯度多样性</td>\n<td>梯度方向差异</td>\n<td>覆盖更广旧知识</td>\n<td>需算梯度，开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类均衡采样</td>\n<td>每类配额</td>\n<td>抗类不均衡</td>\n<td>需任务/类标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性采样</td>\n<td>靠近决策边界</td>\n<td>保留难样本</td>\n<td>易受噪声样本影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"怎么用缓冲区-从混训到梯度约束\">怎么用缓冲区：从混训到梯度约束</h2><p>存下样本只是第一步，如何用它们大有讲究。最朴素的经验回放（Experience Replay, ER）就是把旧样本和新样本拼成一个 batch 联合训练，简单却出奇有效。</p>\n<p>进阶做法把回放从「数据层」提升到「梯度层」。GEM（Gradient Episodic Memory）不直接用旧样本算损失，而是用它们算出旧任务的梯度方向，然后约束当前更新不能让旧任务损失上升——形式上是把当前梯度投影到「与所有旧梯度内积非负」的可行域里：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>g</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{g} = \\arg\\min_g \\|g - g_{\\text{new}}\\|^2 \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\langle g, g_{\\mathcal{M}}^{(j)}\\rangle \\ge 0 \\;\\; \\forall j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5861em;vertical-align:-0.8361em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8361em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3383em;vertical-align:-0.2935em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这恰好针对 <a href=\"../foundations/catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘机理</a> 中「梯度干涉」那一行——通过把更新投影到不与旧梯度冲突的子空间来消解干扰。A-GEM 是它的高效近似，只约束所有旧梯度的平均方向，把计算成本降到可实用。DER（Dark Experience Replay）则进一步存 logits 而非硬标签，用知识蒸馏式的软目标对齐，效果与开销取得了很好的平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"存不了原始数据-生成式回放\">存不了原始数据：生成式回放</h2><p>很多场景因隐私（医疗、人脸）或存储根本不允许保留原始样本。生成式回放（generative replay）的思路是：训一个生成模型记住旧任务的数据分布，需要回放时让它「凭空造」出伪旧样本。经典的 Deep Generative Replay 用 GAN 或 VAE 在每个任务后生成旧数据，伪样本和新数据一起训分类器；生成器自己也在持续学习中被更新。</p>\n<p>近年随扩散模型崛起，用扩散模型做生成式回放质量大幅提升，但代价是生成器本身也会遗忘、且采样开销不小。一个折中是「特征回放」——不重建原始像素，只在隐空间存或生成特征，既绕开隐私问题又省存储，是 2025 至 2026 年的活跃方向。无论哪种，生成式回放都把「记住数据」变成了「记住分布」，是隐私受限场景下回放思想的延续。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回放方法的选型与反模式\">回放方法的选型与反模式</h3><p>回放家族分支多，选错或用错都会让「最强基线」失效。下表把常见误用与正确取舍并列，可作为落地时的核对表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓冲区容量远小于任务数</td>\n<td>只增不换、旧样本永驻</td>\n<td>缓冲区失去代表性</td>\n<td>用蓄水池/类均衡保持均匀覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新任务占比过低</td>\n<td>旧样本比例压倒新样本</td>\n<td>新任务欠拟合</td>\n<td>调 batch 内新旧配比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类增量但缓冲区类别失衡</td>\n<td>随机采样</td>\n<td>少数类被彻底遗忘</td>\n<td>类均衡采样或每类配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私禁存原始样本</td>\n<td>仍直接存原始样本</td>\n<td>合规风险</td>\n<td>转生成式/特征回放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲区未经任何采样策略维护</td>\n<td>只丢最早的样本（FIFO）</td>\n<td>分布被早期任务主导</td>\n<td>蓄水池采样保证历史均匀子集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最需要警惕的是最后一行：FIFO 看起来自然，却让缓冲区被最早的一批样本占满，后期任务的分布从未真正驻留，等于慢性遗忘。回放之所以强，前提是缓冲区始终是历史流的一个有代表性的样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>回放维护有界缓冲区，学新任务时混入旧样本梯度，把模型不断拉回旧任务低损失盆地，是最强基线之一。</li>\n<li>蓄水池采样保证缓冲区是历史均匀子集；GSS、类均衡、不确定性等策略按样本价值优化保留谁。</li>\n<li>经验回放在数据层混训；GEM/A-GEM 在梯度层约束更新不增旧损失，直接消解梯度干涉；DER 用软标签蒸馏。</li>\n<li>不能存原始数据时，生成式回放用 GAN/VAE/扩散模型造伪旧样本，特征回放在隐空间操作以兼顾隐私与存储。</li>\n<li>回放最符合大脑睡眠回放的生物直觉，常与 EWC 等正则化方法组合使用以进一步提升。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Lopez-Paz &amp; Ranzato《Gradient Episodic Memory》(NeurIPS 2017)；Shin 等《Deep Generative Replay》(NeurIPS 2017)；Buzzega 等《Dark Experience Replay》(NeurIPS 2020)；《A Comprehensive Survey on Continual Learning in Generative Models》(arXiv:2506.13045, 2025)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"回放与排练","id":"回放与排练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲区怎么填：采样与管理策略","id":"缓冲区怎么填-采样与管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么用缓冲区：从混训到梯度约束","id":"怎么用缓冲区-从混训到梯度约束"},{"level":2,"text":"存不了原始数据：生成式回放","id":"存不了原始数据-生成式回放"},{"level":3,"text":"回放方法的选型与反模式","id":"回放方法的选型与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"正则化方法 EWC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/methods/regularization-ewc"},"next":{"title":"参数隔离与动态架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/methods/parameter-isolation"}}